&ANALYZE-RESUME

&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE setConstraintFiltroOperPad DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE setConstraintFiltroOperPad :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:    Seta as vari veis de controle para queries contendo
              a opera‡Æo padrÆo inicial e final. 
  Parameters: ipar1:p-inicial:Oper PadrÆo Inicial
              ipar2:p-final:  Oper PadrÆo Final 
 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
   def input parameter p-inicial      as char.
   def input parameter p-final        as char.
  
      assign c-inicial      = p-inicial.
      assign c-final        = p-final.
      
   RETURN "OK":U.
   
END PROCEDURE.

